content.text:
The evidence points to one root cause: ts-travel-service's database calls. ts-travel2-service's shift is within normal variance (all 200s), so I'm not naming it.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-travel-service",
      "fault_kind": "database_call_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, count(*) AS n, quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6 AS p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-travel-service' AND span_name IN ('SELECT ts.trip','SELECT Trip','TripRepository.findAll') GROUP BY 1", "claim": "Travel-service DB span 'SELECT ts.trip' p95 rose to ~26.8s, versus ~0.6ms in normal traffic."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT 'norm' AS p, span_name, quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6 AS p95_ms FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-travel-service' AND span_name='SELECT ts.trip' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "In the normal period the same DB span had p95 of about 0.58ms."},
        {"kind": "log", "sql": "SELECT level, message, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_logs WHERE service_name='ts-travel-service' AND level IN ('ERROR','SEVERE') GROUP BY 1,2 ORDER BY n DESC", "claim": "Travel-service logs HikariPool connection timeouts and JDBC connection acquisition failures during the incident."},
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT metric, avg(value) AS avg_v, max(value) AS max_v FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE service_name='ts-travel-service' AND metric IN ('k8s.pod.cpu.usage','k8s.pod.memory.working_set') GROUP BY 1", "claim": "Travel-service pod CPU and memory stay low, so the slowdown is not resource exhaustion in the pod."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "ts-travel-service", "to": "ts-route-plan-service", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) AS n, quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6 AS p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-route-plan-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1,2,3", "claim": "Route-plan server spans return HTTP 500 with p95 about 60s after travel-service calls stall."}]},
    {"from": "ts-route-plan-service", "to": "ts-travel-plan-service", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) AS n, quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6 AS p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1,2,3", "claim": "Travel-plan server spans return HTTP 500 with p95 about 60s, inheriting the route-plan failures."}]},
    {"from": "ts-travel-plan-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) AS n, quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6 AS p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND span_name LIKE '%travelplanservice%' GROUP BY 1,2,3", "claim": "Dashboard travelPlan requests take about 20s and return 200 after the upstream 500s, so users see slow responses."}]}
  ]
}
```

